# RDISH.OBJ - the radar antenna, WIRE CITY style: a SIX-panel dish where
# the trainer's had eight. Faceted on purpose - the whole world is built
# of flat chunks, and a smooth bowl read as a foreign object among them.
# Modelled around the origin: the origin IS the spin axis, and the dish
# looks down -Z, so the game turns it by yawing the model.
